**One deliberate departure from the dispatch, printed in §3.3 rather than carried silently:** "`--limit 250` per task" is per *subtask* on the MMLU group — ~12,000+ requests, not 250 — so the design pins the item count (57 subjects × 40 = 2,280 plus 250 × 3), requires the spike to audit it, and states up front that ±1.5 pp is only resolvable on MMLU, never on a 250-item task.
